          "kind": "IDEA",
          "text": "Cross-cutting test design that applies to all ideas above. Use decision-point-level retrospective evaluation, with propensity or situational matching where choices are confounded, and report break-even margins rather than claimed wins.",
          "status": "UNVERIFIED",
