          "kind": "ASSUMPTION",
          "text": "Public minor-league tracking data is consistent enough across levels and seasons to serve as pre-decision information. This is a risk to (d).",
          "status": "UNVERIFIED",
          "extractor": "line_grammar/v1"
        },
        {
          "id": "hd-20261009-212841-eccdc1b3971d/candidates/0/2/claim/10",
