          "kind": "ASSUMPTION",
          "text": "The value at stake accumulates across many prospects to something meaningful for one club. This is plausible for (c), but outcomes lag by years.",
          "status": "UNVERIFIED",
          "extractor": "line_grammar/v1"
        },
        {
