        },
        {
          "id": "hd-20261009-212841-eccdc1b3971d/candidates/0/2/claim/29",
          "candidate_id": "hd-20261009-212841-eccdc1b3971d/candidates/0/2",
          "kind": "ASSUMPTION",
          "text": "This is included as a challenge case. It meets (a) and (d) partly, but fails timeliness on (b) because outcomes lag by five or more years. Public amateur data may also be thin compared with private scouting, which weakens (d).",
