        "Eligibility rules for position-player pitching have changed over time, which shrinks the comparable pool for criterion (a).",
        "Overlap with the explored \"opposing bullpen availability\" family is partial; this idea concerns the club's own bullpen.",
        "Promotion choices are confounded by private scouting, injury, and roster need, so a retrospective comparison is selection-biased; criterion (b) is observable but not causal.",
        "This differs from the explored \"call-up translation\" family because it concerns minor-to-minor moves; it could still be judged duplicative.",
