    },
    {
      "id": "hd-20261009-212841-eccdc1b3971d/baseline/0/0/claim/22",
      "candidate_id": "hd-20261009-212841-eccdc1b3971d/baseline/0/0",
      "kind": "UNKNOWN",
      "text": "reliever_rest_and_warmup_cost_public_proxy",
      "status": "UNVERIFIED",
      "extractor": "line_grammar/v1"
    },
    {
      "id": "hd-20261009-212841-eccdc1b3971d/baseline/0/0/claim/23",
      "candidate_id": "hd-20261009-212841-eccdc1b3971d/baseline/0/0",
      "kind": "IDEA",
      "text": "Pinch-hit and platoon substitution. Owner: manager and bench coach. Decision: pinch-hit, pinch-run or defensive-substitute in a given state, often several times per week. Cases: every late-inning plate appearance league-wide each season where a bench player was available, from public lineups and play-by-play. Outcome: plate-appearance run value and later defensive consequences. Baseline: handedness platoon plus \"save the bench for extras.\" Intervention: an optimizer that prices the bench option value against current leverage and the opponent's likely pitching counter-move.",
      "status": "UNVERIFIED",
      "extractor": "line_grammar/v1"
    },
    {
      "id": "hd-20261009-212841-eccdc1b3971d/baseline/0/0/claim/24",
      "candidate_id": "hd-20261009-212841-eccdc1b3971d/baseline/0/0",
      "kind": "ASSUMPTION",
      "text": "Counterparty response (the opponent changing pitchers) drives part of the outcome, which partly reintroduces the problem the critique raised.",
      "status": "UNVERIFIED",
      "extractor": "line_grammar/v1"
    },
    {
      "id": "hd-20261009-212841-eccdc1b3971d/baseline/0/0/claim/25",
      "candidate_id": "hd-20261009-212841-eccdc1b3971d/baseline/0/0",
      "kind": "ASSUMPTION",
      "text": "The value of the bench option in extra innings is small under the automatic-runner rule, but that rule's effect must be verified.",
      "status": "UNVERIFIED",
      "extractor": "line_grammar/v1"
    },
    {
      "id": "hd-20261009-212841-eccdc1b3971d/baseline/0/0/claim/26",
      "candidate_id": "hd-20261009-212841-eccdc1b3971d/baseline/0/0",
      "kind": "UNKNOWN",
      "text": "cubs_bench_composition_by_game",
      "status": "UNVERIFIED",
      "extractor": "line_grammar/v1"
    },
    {
      "id": "hd-20261009-212841-eccdc1b3971d/baseline/0/0/claim/27",
      "candidate_id": "hd-20261009-212841-eccdc1b3971d/baseline/0/0",
      "kind": "UNKNOWN",
      "text": "public_availability_of_bench_player_unavailability_reasons",
      "status": "UNVERIFIED",
      "extractor": "line_grammar/v1"
    },
    {
      "id": "hd-20261009-212841-eccdc1b3971d/baseline/0/0/claim/28",
      "candidate_id": "hd-20261009-212841-eccdc1b3971d/baseline/0/0",
      "kind": "IDEA",
      "text": "Manager replay challenge timing. Owner: manager and replay coordinator. Decision: challenge or not on close plays, multiple times per week. Cases: every challengeable close play league-wide each season, with public overturn records. Outcome: call overturned or confirmed, plus challenge retention. Baseline: challenge when the video room signals high confidence. Intervention: a break-even threshold that weighs overturn probability against the value of the play and the option value of the remaining challenge.",
      "status": "UNVERIFIED",
      "extractor": "line_grammar/v1"
    },
    {
      "id": "hd-20261009-212841-eccdc1b3971d/baseline/0/0/claim/29",
      "candidate_id": "hd-20261009-212841-eccdc1b3971d/baseline/0/0",
      "kind": "ASSUMPTION",
      "text": "Unchallenged close plays are not cleanly logged publicly, so criterion (a) may fail for the negative class.",
      "status": "UNVERIFIED",
      "extractor": "line_grammar/v1"
    },
    {
      "id": "hd-20261009-212841-eccdc1b3971d/baseline/0/0/claim/30",
      "candidate_id": "hd-20261009-212841-eccdc1b3971d/baseline/0/0",
      "kind": "ASSUMPTION",
      "text": "This is distinct from ABS ball-strike challenges but may share option-value logic.",
      "status": "UNVERIFIED",
      "extractor": "line_grammar/v1"
    },
    {
      "id": "hd-20261009-212841-eccdc1b3971d/baseline/0/0/claim/31",
