      "kind": "IDEA",
      "text": "Catcher game calling and pitch selection; owner catcher, pitching coach and advance scouting; decision is the pitch type and location per pitch, made on every pitch; historical cases are every pitch in public pitch-tracking data, extremely numerous; observable outcome is pitch run value; simple baseline is the pitcher's season pitch mix by count; intervention is a count-and-hitter-specific suggestion set for pre-game planning.",
