      "text": "Intentional walk, infield-in and bunt choices in close late-game situations; owner is the manager; the decision comes up a few times per week; league-wide cases number in the thousands per season in public play-by-play; the observable outcome is the change in win expectancy; the simple baseline is a generic win-expectancy chart; the intervention adjusts for the specific batter, on-deck hitter, pitcher and fielder ranges.",
