      "kind": "IDEA",
      "text": "Problem=batting-order construction; owner=manager; decision=lineup order, set daily; historical cases=every lineup league-wide; outcome=runs scored, public; baseline=a conventional order with the best on-base hitters near the top; intervention=a simulation-optimized order.",
      "status": "UNVERIFIED",
